he config-reference\nworkflow only fires on ",["$","code",null,{"children":"v1.*"}],"."]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Push the tag to your fork first."}]," That triggers the image workflow in\nyour own repository, which is the dry run. Only push to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"upstream"}]," once\nit is green."]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Confirm the config reference regenerated."}]," Pushing the tag upstream\ntriggers ",["$","code",null,{"children":"config-reference.yaml"}],", which opens an auto-merging PR against\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"main"}],". If it did not fire, re-run it from the Actions tab or regenerate\nby hand with\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"bun --filter @forge/docs gen:config-reference v1.x.y"}],"."]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Write the release notes"}],", attributing every entry to its author, then\npublish. Publishing is what triggers the signed-artifacts workflow."]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Verify the assets landed"}],": for each target, a ",["$","code",null,{"children":".tar.gz"}]," plus its\n",["$","code",null,{"children":".sig"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":".pem"}],", an ",["$","code",null,{"children":".spdx.json"}]," SBOM, and an ",["$","code",null,{"children":".intoto.jsonl"}],"\nprovenance file."]}]}]]}]
